359
00:36:49,987 --> 00:36:51,020
Just a moment, please.

360
00:36:59,483 --> 00:37:01,576
Where did it go? It’s usually right here.

361
00:37:01,763 --> 00:37:02,656
What are you looking for?

362
00:37:03,003 --> 00:37:03,636
The lighter.

363
00:37:03,773 --> 00:37:05,690
The lighter that was right here. Where did it go?

364
00:37:05,830 --> 00:37:06,316
Oh.

365
00:37:07,070 --> 00:37:07,903
Here it is.

366
00:37:08,290 --> 00:37:10,036
