375
00:37:54,096 --> 00:37:55,736
Shouldn’t you be thanking me instead?

376
00:37:56,376 --> 00:37:58,727
If it weren’t for me, none of us would’ve made it.

377
00:38:01,960 --> 00:38:05,003
I knew you could handle it, Dear.

378
00:38:05,269 --> 00:38:07,610
Keep sulking and no one will want you.

379
00:38:10,556 --> 00:38:13,023
Hey, newbie. Mop the floor, too.

380
00:38:16,536 --> 00:38:18,223
So what exactly happened?

381
00:38:21,036 --> 00:38:22,396
It was just a customer.

382
00:38:23,170 --> 00:38:24,236
You’ll get used to it.

383
00:38:39,844 --> 00:38:40,942
