This way, please.

397
00:40:07,738 --> 00:40:09,011
Move. I’ll do it myself.

398
00:40:11,683 --> 00:40:12,918
Anything else, sweetheart?

399
00:40:13,672 --> 00:40:17,575
We’ve got the new ultra-thin condom here.

400
00:40:18,250 --> 00:40:19,724
If you don’t have anyone to help you use it,

401
00:40:20,498 --> 00:40:22,217
I could help.

402
00:40:23,376 --> 00:40:24,430
Show some manners to the customers.

403
00:40:25,102 --> 00:40:25,976
Mind your own business.

404
00:40:27,907 --> 00:40:29,512
There's no need to pay.

405
00:40:29,742 --> 00:40:31,946
It's on me.

406
00:40:32,425 --> 00:40:33,376
Thank you.

407
00:40:34,073 --> 00:40:35,417
Bye!

408
00:40:38,652 --> 00:40:40,235
If you harass another customer like that,

409
00:40:40,259 --> 00:40:41,465
I’ll report you to Cherd next time.

410
00:40:44,816 --> 00:40:45,496
Why?

411
00:40:48,965 --> 00:40:50,421
You're working here.

412
00:40:51,104 --> 00:40:52,646
That means you're no different from me.

413
00:40:53,628 --> 00:40:55,428
Don’t act so high and mighty.

414
00:40:56,288 --> 00:40:57,581
It pisses me off.

415
00:40:59,327 --> 00:41:00,569
Let me tell you something.

416
00:41:00,983 --> 00:41:02,917
All this place cares about is the rules

417
00:41:03,998 --> 00:41:05,314
and I haven’t broken any.

418
00:41:15,393 --> 00:41:16,777
Would you like me to heat up

419
00:41:16,801 --> 00:41:18,109
the chocolate lava cake, beautiful?

420
00:41:20,593 --> 00:41:21,466
Get to work.

421
00:41:28,956 --> 00:41:30,120
Is it your birthday today?

422
00:41:31,604 --> 00:41:36,116
Happy birthday to you.

423
00:41:36,997 --> 00:41:37,645
Rule number seven.

424
00:41:37,917 --> 00:41:39,323
When heating food in the microwave,

425
00:41:39,526 --> 00:41:41,217
employees must not turn around to look at customers

426
00:41:41,241 --> 00:41:44,350
until the microwave beeps to signal that it’s done.

427
00:41:48,346 --> 00:41:52,413
Happy birthday to you.

428
00:41:52,737 --> 00:41:53,862
Anyone to celebrate with?

429
00:41:54,466 --> 00:41:56,643
You can invite me.

430
00:42:07,162 --> 00:42:07,795
Rule number two.

431
00:42:08,193 --> 00:42:09,142
Employees must never respond

432
00:42:09,166 --> 00:42:11,318
when a customer calls them by name.

433
00:42:13,658 --> 00:42:14,713
That’s cheating.

434
00:42:18,250 --> 00:42:20,501
Rules are rules.

435
00:42:52,588 --> 00:42:53,625
It's you.

436
00:43:53,150 --> 00:43:54,721
Thank you for shopping at Sunny Mart.

437
00:44:02,291 --> 00:44:03,643
Thank you for shopping at Sunny Mart.

438
00:44:28,313 --> 00:44:29,032
Because here...

439
00:44:30,130 --> 00:44:32,299
The rules are a matter of life and death.

440
00:44:55,443 --> 00:44:58,303
Could I get an advance for the next 10 days?

441
00:44:58,551 --> 00:44:59,863
Ten thousand baht is nothing.

442
00:45:00,368 --> 00:45:01,113
How’s that supposed to be enough?

443
00:45:01,395 --> 00:45:02,676
Nava!

444
00:45:02,701 --> 00:45:04,693
You need to get me a hundred thousand.

445
00:45:06,142 --> 00:45:08,884
