446
00:45:09,735 --> 00:45:11,908
So what exactly are those things?

447
00:45:12,895 --> 00:45:14,246
It doesn't matter what they are.

448
00:45:14,707 --> 00:45:15,613
One thing’s for sure.

449
00:45:15,947 --> 00:45:17,082
They can kill you.

450
00:45:18,040 --> 00:45:19,715
You know how dangerous this place is.

451
00:45:19,740 --> 00:45:20,556
So what?

452
00:45:20,743 --> 00:45:22,506
Do I have to follow you around every second?
